
Failat 21

Echo ""
Echo "Please, PLEASE, backup your whole Zeus: directory before"
Echo "performing this update!  Major changes have taken place,"
Echo "and if you have problems some configurations (such as"
Echo "file areas) have changed and are incompatible with Zeus"
Echo "1.1.  Backups of some configurations will be made by this"
Echo "script, but don't depent on them.  Also, please quit Zeus"
Echo "(using Control-Esc or your set hot-key) before continuing."
Echo ""
Ask "Enter Y to continue, or N to quit."

If Not Warn
   Echo "Exiting..."
   Wait 3
   quit
endif

Echo ""
Echo "Okay!"
Echo ""
Echo "Updating file configuration.."
Echo ""
Echo "Old Zeus:Config/File/FileAreas.Dat renamed to Zeus:Config/File/FileAreas.Dat_1.1"
Copy zeus:Config/File/FileAreas.Dat zeus:Config/File/FileAreas.Dat_1.1

Echo "Old Zeus:Config/File/ExtraPaths.Dat renamed to Zeus:Config/File/ExtraPaths.Dat_1.1"
Copy zeus:Config/File/ExtraPaths.Dat zeus:Config/File/ExtraPaths.Dat_1.1

Echo "Updating it to Zeus 1.2 format.."

11->12Converter

Copy t:Convert.Paths zeus:Config/File/ExtraPaths.Dat
Copy t:Convert.FileBase zeus:Config/File/FileAreas.Dat

Echo ""
Echo "Done.  Now installing binaries."
Echo ""

Makedir Zeus:Config/GUI

if not exists Zeus:Libs
   Copy Libs/#? Libs: CLONE
   Delete Libs all
endif

Copy #? Zeus: ALL CLONE

Delete Zeus:11->12Converter
Delete Zeus:Do_Update
Delete Zeus:Do_Update.info

Echo ""
Echo "Done!  Delete the UPDATE_1.2 directory at your leisure."
Echo ""
Wait 10


